"""
SchedulerSkill — APScheduler-based recurring task runner for CDCN Agent.

Adapts OpenCLAW's heartbeat pattern:
  • heartbeat.md is the standing checklist, read on every run (like HEARTBEAT.md)
  • The LLM receives current context + heartbeat.md instructions and decides
    whether anything needs reporting.  If its reply begins or ends with
    HEARTBEAT_OK (and is short), no notification is sent — matching OpenCLAW's
    ack-suppression behaviour.
  • Active-hours gate: all jobs check state_manager.is_accepting_messages()
    before running, equivalent to OpenCLAW's activeHours window.
  • Every job is wrapped in a try/except; exceptions are logged and the
    scheduler continues — the runner never crashes.
  • All jobs log start and completion to the audit log with elapsed duration.

Jobs registered
───────────────
  heartbeat_job          — interval, HEARTBEAT_INTERVAL_HOURS (wake only)
  auto_index_job         — interval, 6 h (wake only)
  journal_job            — cron at JOURNAL_TIME (wake only)
  weekly_digest_job      — cron Monday 07:15 (wake only)
  monthly_governance_job — cron 1st of month 08:00 (always, logs if dream)
  funding_feed_job       — cron 07:30 and 12:00 daily (wake only)
  session_archive_job    — cron 03:00 daily (dream mode, NOT wake-gated)
"""
